    "abstract": "This reference guide collects existing Lax definitions of graph classes,\ncontainment relations, width parameters, and sparsity measures. Its chapters\ngroup the source concepts by subject. In the paper view, each marked passage\nopens the original concept and its Lean formalization beside the PDF.\n\nThe submission declares no concepts, statements, or proofs of its own. The\nreferenced definitions retain their original submission identities; similar\nnames in different submissions are not identified with one another here.\n"
  },
